      "rootClass": "section nsw-section",
      "visibleText": "Canteen All canteens in NSW public schools must meet certain requirements. These include providing more healthy food and drink options – to make the healthy choice an easy choice for students. Visit Healthy school canteens to learn more. Bon Appetit Catering operate the Fort Street High School canteen and is a family-operated business with over 20 years of experience. They are dedicated to providing high-quality, healthy food options to students and staff. Our canteen is open daily from 8:00am, offering a delicious breakfast menu. Payment can be made via either cash or card or via Flexischools. Our school uses Flexischools for online ordering. Flexischools, operates in more than 1650 schools across Australia, enabling cashless ordering for schools.",
